{"title":"Frost Drake","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 59 Frost Dragon that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 3 times (5.5% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 5× XP and 5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/frost-drake\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/frost-drake?lv=58\">Lv 58 <span>95</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/frost-drake?lv=59\">Lv 59</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/frost-drake?lv=61\">Lv 61 <span>182</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/frost-drake?lv=62\">Lv 62 <span>150</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/frost-drake?lv=63\">Lv 63 <span>213</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/frost-drake?lv=64\">Lv 64 <span>168</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/frost-drake?lv=65\">Lv 65 <span>11</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/frost-drake?lv=66\">Lv 66 <span>12</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/frost-drake?lv=58\" title=\"Pick level 58\"><td><b>58</b></td><td>423</td><td>36.4</td><td>2,900</td><td class=\"muted\">1,269 · 51 · 8,700</td><td>95</td><td><span c